    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slice through fear in this high-speed 2D hack-and-slash!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/7bb735930e6db45ef1216dacf1906d87.poster.avif?t=1752753592\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/7bb735930e6db45ef1216dacf1906d87.webm?t=1752753592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/7bb735930e6db45ef1216dacf1906d87.mp4?t=1752753592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Asbak</strong> is a fast-paced hack-and-slash platformer that weaves the chaos of roguelikes, the depth of character-action RPGs, and the heart of a story-driven adventure into one relentless experience. In a world where the veil between the physical world and the paranormal realm has been torn apart, <strong><i>Demons</i></strong> flood the entire nation and you need to slay them with style \u2014 one battle, one story, one soul at a time.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/562a65fdeccc205fc1f4ccb48b8ffe48.avif?t=1752753592\" width=613 height=204 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/8863795085bc9d4f59ff1c327add639a.poster.avif?t=1752753592\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/8863795085bc9d4f59ff1c327add639a.webm?t=1752753592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/8863795085bc9d4f59ff1c327add639a.mp4?t=1752753592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team of elite demon hunters by forging contracts with <i><strong>Sorcerers</strong></i> \u2014 gifted humans with paranormal powers. Accomplish Demon hunting missions, collect mythical artifacts, and uncover the secrets of the bizarre conspiracy that's been looming over the entire nation.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slice through fear in this high-speed 2D hack-and-slash!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/7bb735930e6db45ef1216dacf1906d87.poster.avif?t=1752753592\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/7bb735930e6db45ef1216dacf1906d87.webm?t=1752753592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/7bb735930e6db45ef1216dacf1906d87.mp4?t=1752753592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Asbak</strong> is a fast-paced hack-and-slash platformer that weaves the chaos of roguelikes, the depth of character-action RPGs, and the heart of a story-driven adventure into one relentless experience. In a world where the veil between the physical world and the paranormal realm has been torn apart, <strong><i>Demons</i></strong> flood the entire nation and you need to slay them with style \u2014 one battle, one story, one soul at a time.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/562a65fdeccc205fc1f4ccb48b8ffe48.avif?t=1752753592\" width=613 height=204 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/8863795085bc9d4f59ff1c327add639a.poster.avif?t=1752753592\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/8863795085bc9d4f59ff1c327add639a.webm?t=1752753592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932110/extras/8863795085bc9d4f59ff1c327add639a.mp4?t=1752753592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your team of elite demon hunters by forging contracts with <i><strong>Sorcerers</strong></i> \u2014 gifted humans with paranormal powers. Accomplish Demon hunting missions, collect mythical artifacts, and uncover the secrets of the bizarre conspiracy that's been looming over the entire nation.</p>",
    "short_description": "Asbak is a fast-paced hack-and-slash platformer where you chase down and slay demons born from humanity\u2019s darkest fears. Move fast, hit hard, and keep the nightmares at bay!",
